<h2>Activity 3 — What's the Fraction?</h2><p>Partition your own 0-to-2 number line into equal-length steps. Mark one number, <strong>do not label it</strong>. Swap with a partner and ask them to infer the division and fraction, with reasoning. There is no single publisher-supplied answer; teachers assess created markings, interpretations and discussion.</p>
